outrageous, you're sort of pulling the mean
in a direction that is not particularly productive.

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:35.300
I mean, that's my concern with that, that
the idea you're proposing,

00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:39.840
um, I think I see what you're saying that
the John Stuart Mill didn't use the phrase

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:41.490
marketplace of ideas.

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:44.030
Uh, but it's not a bad metaphor.

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:49.780
And so if in a real marketplace, you know,
uh, real market places work really well, but

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:53.640
if you had a marketplace which you had a lot
