00:15:06.770 --> 00:15:11.270
Now, I have been very concerned that, um,
into social sciences, which is what we're

00:15:11.270 --> 00:15:12.420
really talking about here.

00:15:12.420 --> 00:15:17.140
We really need the social sciences to work
