who are committed to the academy to say, well

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:29.430
wait a second, here's some counter evidence.

00:15:29.430 --> 00:15:30.710
We used to have that.

00:15:30.710 --> 00:15:35.950
Um, now that we've shifted much further to
